## elaborations.soar -- selection-world: 1 elaboration.

## Elaborate task current-evaluation depth -> sets current-evaluation-depth.
## Copy down over operator no change if same problem space
sp {selection-world*elaborate*task*current-evaluation*depth
   :default
   (state <s> ^problem-space.name <name>
              ^superstate <superstate>)
   (<superstate> ^problem-space.name <name>
                 ^current-evaluation-depth <current-evaluation-depth>)
-->
   (<s> ^current-evaluation-depth <current-evaluation-depth>)
}
